{"3877700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Titan's Shadow Killers", "steam_appid": 3877700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4845580], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Titan's Shadow Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a modern world dominated by criminal organizations and illegal experiments, only one brotherhood remains in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Shadow Killer, a warrior chosen to eliminate monsters created by human experiments and stop Project TITAN from turning the city into a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deadly katana, execute enemies with extreme precision, and face brutal hordes in a linear, action-packed campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack and Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismemberment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign with 5 maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies include:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Criminal organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illegal experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrous creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your health and energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth behind Project TITAN.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Titan's Shadow Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a modern world dominated by criminal organizations and illegal experiments, only one brotherhood remains in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Shadow Killer, a warrior chosen to eliminate monsters created by human experiments and stop Project TITAN from turning the city into a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deadly katana, execute enemies with extreme precision, and face brutal hordes in a linear, action-packed campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack and Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismemberment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign with 5 maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies include:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Criminal organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illegal experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrous creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your health and energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth behind Project TITAN.</p>", "short_description": "Become a Shadow Killer and confront monsters and criminal organizations in a brutal hack-and-slash game featuring dismemberment, fast-paced combat, epic bosses, and a linear, action-packed campaign.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877700/af728fbc388bd02bdd053e2ab8f52872f9a4a200/header.jpg?t=1788322367", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877700/1fbb9d9b884776b913f18bbf7dae788873e08f1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788322367", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877700/1fbb9d9